        "The exact dates of Anne Frank and Margot's deaths remain unclear.",
        "It is thought that both Anne Frank and Margot had symptoms of typhus before February 7, 1945.",
        "Typhus is the disease that Anne Frank and Margot succumbed to."
    ]
}
